-    Compute the distance $D$ to determine if a node should be kept (even if outside the immediate block, it might generate samples within it):
     $$ Q = P_{relative} - \frac{S_{block}}{2} $$
     $$ D = \| \max(Q, 0) \| + \min(\max(Q_x, Q_y, Q_z), 0) $$
